TCSlib.Cryptography.SecretSharing.Efficient	TCSlib.SecretSharing.EfficientScheme.share_poly	theorem	[propext, Quot.sound, Classical.choice]	∀ (self : TCSlib.SecretSharing.EfficientScheme),   ∃ f,     Complexity.PolyTimeComputable f ∧       ∀ (π : self.Pub) (sec : self.Secret π) (r : self.Rand π) (i : self.Party π),         f             (Turing.pairEncode (self.encPub π)               (Turing.pairEncode (self.encSecret π sec) (Turing.pairEncode (self.encRand π r) (self.encParty π i)))) =           self.encShare π ((self.scheme π).share sec r i)
