TCSlib.Cryptography.SecretSharing.Efficient	TCSlib.SecretSharing.invModW_eq	theorem	[propext, Quot.sound]	∀ (z : List Bool),   TCSlib.SecretSharing.invModW z =     Complexity.PrefixByLength.take       (Turing.pairEncode (Complexity.pairFstD z)         (Complexity.BinArith.powMod           (Turing.pairEncode (Complexity.pairSndD z)             (Turing.pairEncode (Complexity.BinArith.sub (Turing.pairEncode (Complexity.pairFstD z) (Nat.bits 2)))               (Complexity.pairFstD z)))))
