TCSlib.Cryptography.SecretSharing.Efficient	TCSlib.SecretSharing.samplesEfficiently_comap	theorem	[propext, Quot.sound, Classical.choice]	∀ {P P' : ℕ → Type} {Draw β : (κ : ℕ) → P κ → Type} {y : (κ : ℕ) → P κ → List Bool}   {encDraw : (κ : ℕ) → (π : P κ) → Draw κ π → List Bool} {encOut : (κ : ℕ) → (π : P κ) → β κ π → List Bool}   {core : (κ : ℕ) → (π : P κ) → Draw κ π → β κ π},   TCSlib.Cryptography.CoinSampling.SamplesEfficiently y encDraw encOut core →     ∀ (φ : (κ : ℕ) → P' κ → P κ),       TCSlib.Cryptography.CoinSampling.SamplesEfficiently (fun κ π => y κ (φ κ π)) (fun κ π => encDraw κ (φ κ π))         (fun κ π => encOut κ (φ κ π)) fun κ π => core κ (φ κ π)
