TCSlib.Cryptography.SecretSharing.ShamirEfficient	TCSlib.Shamir.shamirEfficient_access	theorem	[propext, Quot.sound, Classical.choice]	∀ (b : Complexity.PolyExpr) (π : TCSlib.SecretSharing.ShamirParams),   (TCSlib.Shamir.shamirEfficient b).access π = TCSlib.SecretSharing.AccessStructure.threshold π.k
