TCSlib.Cryptography.SecretSharing.ShamirEfficient	TCSlib.Shamir.shamirScheme	def	[propext, Quot.sound, Classical.choice]	(π : TCSlib.SecretSharing.ShamirParams) →   TCSlib.SecretSharing.Scheme (Fin π.n) (ZMod π.p) (ZMod π.p) (Fin (π.p ^ (π.k - 1)))
TCSlib.Cryptography.SecretSharing.ShamirEfficient	TCSlib.Shamir.shamirScheme_correct	theorem	[propext, Quot.sound, Classical.choice]	∀ (π : TCSlib.SecretSharing.ShamirParams),   (TCSlib.Shamir.shamirScheme π).Correct (TCSlib.SecretSharing.AccessStructure.threshold π.k)
