TCSlib.Cryptography.SecretSharing.ShamirEfficient	TCSlib.Shamir.shareState_eq	theorem	[propext, Quot.sound, Classical.choice]	∀ (p : ℕ) (sec x : ZMod p) (r j : ℕ),   TCSlib.Shamir.shareState p sec x r j =     Turing.pairEncode (Turing.pairEncode p.bits (TCSlib.SecretSharing.resWord x))       (Turing.pairEncode (r / p ^ j).bits         (Turing.pairEncode (TCSlib.SecretSharing.resWord (x ^ (j + 1)))           (TCSlib.SecretSharing.resWord (sec + ∑ t ∈ Finset.range j, ↑(r / p ^ t % p) * x ^ (t + 1)))))
